      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 106358743,
      "text": "キミノヒマラヤキイチゴ は、バラ科キイチゴ属に分類される植物の一種。別名「オニイチゴ」。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Rubus ellipticus",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubus_ellipticus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1355941170,
      "text": "Rubus ellipticus, commonly known as ainselu, golden evergreen raspberry, golden Himalayan raspberry, or yellow Himalayan raspberry, is an Asian species of thorny fruiting shrub in the rose family. Its native range stretches from the Indian subcontinent to southern China and Indochina and the Philippines."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Rubus ellipticus",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubus_ellipticus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 154096303,
      "text": "Rubus ellipticus, comúnmente denominado frambuesa dorada del Himalaya o frambuesa amarilla del Himalaya, es una especie de arbusto espinoso asiático de la familia de las rosas."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Rubus ellipticus",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubus_ellipticus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 209423165,
      "text": "Le piquant lou-lou est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Rosaceae, originaire d'Asie."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Rubus ellipticus",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubus_ellipticus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 73140992,
      "text": "O Rubus elipticus, comumente conhecido como ainselu, framboesa perene dourada, framboesa dourada do Himalaia ou framboesa amarela do Himalaia, é uma espécie asiática de arbusto frutífero espinhoso na família das rosas. É nativo da China, Nepal, Índia, Paquistão, Indochina e Filipinas."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Rubus ellipticus",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rubus_ellipticus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29737151,
      "text": "Rubus ellipticus, umumnya dikenal sebagai ainselu, rasberi hijau tahunan emas, rasberi Himalaya emas, atau rasberi Himalaya kuning, adalah spesies tumbuhan semak berbuah berduri Asia dalam keluarga Rosaceae. Daerah jelajah aslinya terbentang dari anak benua India hingga Tiongkok bagian selatan, Indochina, dan Filipina."
    }
